-- Configuration rows of a project store canonically initialized by the
-- registry at tip f8878bf7e8f17287e6e00929cf5c61da90e42632, captured before
-- `feedback.proximity.risk_threshold` was retired. The rows are byte-exact
-- `sqlite3` dump output for the five populated configuration tables; the
-- table DDL is unchanged by the retirement, and the full-store dump cannot be
-- replayed because its FTS shadow-table writes need `PRAGMA writable_schema`,
-- which the engine's exact-SQL guard refuses.
